---

16. Complexity Must Earn Its Place

CNS should not become complicated merely because it is possible.

If deterministic logic is sufficient:

→ use deterministic logic.

If a small model is sufficient:

→ don't automatically use a huge model.

If a component adds more:

latency

cost

fragility

maintenance

failure surface


than useful capability:

→ CNS should be able to reject or remove it.

> Simplicity is not the goal. Useful capability is the goal.




